---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Environmental Strategy | Toile Blanche | Saint-Paul de Vence"
  description="Our commitment to net zero by 2030. Not as a corporate obligation, but as an artistic one."
>
  <Nav theme="light" />

  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="info-header">
      <div class="info-header-inner">
        <p class="info-eyebrow">Strategy, Net Zero 2030</p>
        <h1>Environmental Strategy</h1>
        <p class="info-tagline">In 2026, Toile Blanche was declared a work of art. With that comes a responsibility: to ensure it lasts.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="info-body">
      <div class="info-body-inner">
        <p>Our commitment is net zero by 2030. Not as a corporate obligation, but as an artistic one. A property built over twenty years, from stone and gardens and light, deserves to be here for another two centuries.</p>
        <p class="info-highlight">Local ingredients. Pesticide-free gardens.</p>
        <p>The details are in the full strategy document below.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  @import '/css/info-page.css';
</style>
